From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Mark Harfouche <mark.harfouche@gmail.com>
Date: Sat, 28 Nov 2026 09:28:37 -0500
Subject: [PATCH] Include <cfloat> for FLT_MANT_DIG in Distributions.cpp

pytorch/pytorch#204153 added a use of FLT_MANT_DIG to
aten/src/ATen/native/Distributions.cpp without including <cfloat>. It
only compiled because another header pulled it in. With clang/libc++ 22
on osx-arm64, nothing does any more:

  Distributions.cpp:553:55: error: use of undeclared identifier 'FLT_MANT_DIG'

Include the header directly. pytorch main has the same code, so this
should be sent upstream.
---
 aten/src/ATen/native/Distributions.cpp | 1 +
 1 file changed, 1 insertion(+)

diff --git a/aten/src/ATen/native/Distributions.cpp b/aten/src/ATen/native/Distributions.cpp
index 4f6708e..977d356 100644
--- a/aten/src/ATen/native/Distributions.cpp
+++ b/aten/src/ATen/native/Distributions.cpp
@@ -4,6 +4,7 @@
 #include <ATen/TensorIterator.h>
 #include <ATen/TensorOperators.h>
 #include <c10/util/Exception.h>
+#include <cfloat>
 #include <optional>
 
 #include <ATen/CPUGeneratorImpl.h>
